  lines:
  - character: Player
    text: "I\u2019m collecting stories about Tanfana."
  - character: Villager
    text: "Then here\u2019s another one. Some people believed she wasn\u2019t a goddess
      at all."
  - character: Player
    text: Who was she then?
  - character: Villager
    text: A queen. A powerful woman whose story grew larger with every generation
      until she became a legend.
  - character: Player
    text: So nobody knows the truth?
  - character: Villager
    text: "If they ever did, it\u2019s been forgotten."
